		<nav aria-label="secondary"><ul class="fsNavLevel1"><li class="fsNavCurrentPage"><a href="/bcps-departments/strategy-innovation/demographics-enrollment-planning/redistricting/overview">Overview</a></li><li><a href="/bcps-departments/strategy-innovation/demographics-enrollment-planning/redistricting/former-board-districts">Former Board Districts</a></li><li><a href="/bcps-departments/strategy-innovation/demographics-enrollment-planning/redistricting/population-change-by-district-2020-us-census">Population Change by District 2020 U.S. Census</a></li><li><a href="/bcps-departments/strategy-innovation/demographics-enrollment-planning/redistricting/powerpoint-redistricting">PowerPoint Redistricting</a></li><li><a href="/bcps-departments/strategy-innovation/demographics-enrollment-planning/redistricting/2021-redistricting-timeline">2021 Redistricting Timeline</a></li><li><a href="/bcps-departments/strategy-innovation/demographics-enrollment-planning/redistricting/schools-by-district/district-1">Schools by District</a></li></ul></nav>
