				<main id="fsPageContent" class="fsPageContent">




							<div class="fsPageLayout fsLayout fsOneColumnLayout fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_895300" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_895301"  >

				<section class="fsElement fsContent" id="fsEl_895306" data-use-new="true" >

				<header>
				<h1 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_895306">Redistricting</h1>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<!-- Global site tag (gtag.js) - Google Analytics -->
<script async="" src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=UA-35780886-1"></script>
<script>
  window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
  function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
  gtag('js', new Date());

  gtag('config', 'UA-35780886-1');
</script>

	</div>


	</section>
	
	<div class="fsElement fsContent" id="fsEl_895305" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<div><p style="text-align: center;"><figure class="fsImage"><picture><img alt="Redestricting" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1730402225/browardschoolscom/lkyswibnusivykvdns29/istock-1287428874-cropped.jpg%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1730402225/browardschoolscom/lkyswibnusivykvdns29/istock-1287428874-cropped.jpg%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1730402225/browardschoolscom/lkyswibnusivykvdns29/istock-1287428874-cropped.jpg%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto/v1730402225/browardschoolscom/lkyswibnusivykvdns29/istock-1287428874-cropped.jpg%22,%22width%22:1200}]" data-resource-description="" data-resource-filename="istock-1287428874-cropped.jpg" data-resource-uuid="4b64b472-54e8-4e22-8728-b33b8539509a" id="" role="presentation" src=""></picture></figure></p></div>

	</div>


	</div>
	
	<div class="fsElement fsContent" id="fsEl_895303" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<div><p><span style="font-size: medium;">Section 1001.36, Florida Statutes, requires the School Board of Broward County, Florida (SBBC) to make changes "<em>deemed necessary in the boundaries of any district school board member residence area at a meeting of the school board in odd-numbered years</em>" and that no boundary change that "would affect the residence qualifications of any incumbent member shall disqualify such incumbent member during the term for which he or she is elected."</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: medium;">Following its review of 2020 U.S. Census data, SBBC will redraw the seven residence area boundaries to achieve board member residence areas that are reflective of the population changes that have occurred since the 2010 Census and approve the new boundaries at an upcoming Board meeting.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: medium;"><span class="black-color-and-bold-text">The proposed School Board member district map will not impact school attendance zones. It will not impact where your child attends school. It may, however, impact which School Board member district you may vote in</span>. After a number of public meetings, the School Board will approve a revised school board member district map, but you can view interactive, preliminary maps of each district and obtain additional information below. You can also provide comments throughout the redistricting process by emailing <a href="mailto:BCPS_2021redistricting@browardschools.com">BCPS_2021redistricting@browardschools.com</a>.<br><br>The 2021 single-school board member voting redistricting process concluded on November 9, 2021, by the adoption of Resolution #22-102 to change four small areas to balance the total population of the seven single-member voting districts that are now more compact.<br></span></p>
<ul style="list-style-type: disc;">
<li>ADOPTED - <a href="https://granicus_production_attachments.s3.amazonaws.com/browardschools/9254daeb7bfe3560e4f9a250bcfc42460.pdf" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" title="November 9, 2021 Regular School Board Meeting - Resolution #22-102 Seven Single-Member School Board Voting Districts (Item RR-1)">November 9, 2021 Regular School Board Meeting - Resolution #22-102 Seven Single-Member School Board Voting Districts (Item RR-1)</a></li>
<li><a href="/fs/resource-manager/view/8b4636f4-e208-40db-92f0-23b46ec1aa48" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" title="Proposed Change Area Detailed Maps">Proposed Change Area Detailed Maps</a></li>
<li><a href="https://granicus_production_attachments.s3.amazonaws.com/browardschools/7071ea89b85a805e6413855b6c9c8da40.pdf" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" title="November 3, 2021 School Board Workshop - School Board Voting District Draft Map">November 3, 2021 School Board Workshop - School Board Voting District Draft Map</a></li>
<li><a href="/fs/resource-manager/view/7470e75f-1b12-4386-9189-6150d0a76e3f" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" title="Invitation to Participate in Community Meetings">Invitation to Participate in Community Meetings</a> (<a href="/fs/resource-manager/view/bcff4a50-5331-4a47-acad-2a128ff944d7" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" title="Invitación para participar en reuniones comunitarias">Spanish</a>, <a href="/fs/resource-manager/view/6f611747-e2c6-4938-b9b4-af6b83e34686" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" title="Convite para participar de reuniões da comunidade">Portuguese</a>, <a href="/fs/resource-manager/view/fff966dd-db79-475a-90e7-acaf4caece74" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" title="Envitasyon pou patisipe nan reyinyon kominotè yo">Haitian Creole</a>)</li>
<li><a href="https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_NGU1OTQyNjAtNzJkNC00YjhkLWEzNDYtYzE1NmEzZWJhNmIx%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%22eeacb5cb-5370-4358-a96a-a3783c95d422%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22285b1edd-7d18-4119-934c-047ec2b48986%22%2c%22IsBroadcastMeeting%22%3atrue%7d&amp;btype=a&amp;role=a" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" title="October 9, 2021 Virtual Meeting Recording">October 9, 2021 Virtual Meeting Recording</a></li>
<li><a href="/fs/resource-manager/view/01320fda-dd82-44dc-9915-2bb7184c56f4" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" title="2021 Board Items &amp; Memoranda">2021 Board Items &amp; Memoranda</a></li>
<li><a href="/fs/resource-manager/view/c0353499-c1ee-4b09-8e8f-0eec4b3a0956" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" title="Legal and Guiding Principles">Legal and Guiding Principles</a></li>
<li><a href="/fs/resource-manager/view/e2b3c52e-ed49-48c8-a417-0ef05e3d3b1e" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" title="Instructions for Using DRA 2020 Interactive Map Platform">Instructions for Using DRA 2020 Interactive Map Platform</a></li>
<li><a href="https://davesredistricting.org/maps#viewmap::ab88bc8e-3999-43a4-8e0a-92f6d0c7647d" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" title="DRA 2020 Interactive Map Platform">DRA 2020 Interactive Map Platform</a></li>
<li><a href="/fs/resource-manager/view/9e9aebf7-6635-4732-848c-dd733fb5b8b5" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" title="Archive – 2011-2013 Redistricting Process">Archive – 2011-2013 Redistricting Process</a></li>
</ul>
<p> </p>
<p><span style="font-size: medium;">Should you need additional information, contact Jill Young, Director, Demographics &amp; Enrollment Planning, <span class="black-color-and-bold-text">754-321-2565</span>, or <a href="mailto:BCPS_2021redistricting@browardschools.com">BCPS_2021redistricting@browardschools.com</a>.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: medium;"> </span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: medium;">Bookmark <a href="http://browardschools.com/redistricting" title="browardschools.com/redistricting">browardschools.com/redistricting</a> for redistricting news and resources.</span></p>
<p> </p>
<p> </p></div>

	</div>


	</div>
	



	</div>
	



	</div>
	



